{"out": "../../../output/cant-let-go-draft/part2.mp4", "audio": "p2.wav", "speed": 1.0, "tail": 0.45, "music_fade": 0.5, "music_cues": [{"shot": 0, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/echoes.mp3", "start": 100.0}], "music_volume": 0.33, "style": {"grade": "night", "captions": "underline", "caption_y": 0.86, "vignette": 0.5, "grain": 4}, "shots": [{"text": "There's an old idea in psychology called the Zeigarnik effect.", "v": {"mg": "loop", "text": "OPEN LOOP", "labels": ["what if", "why", "one more time"]}, "captions": false, "overlays": [{"mg": "title", "text": "THE ZEIGARNIK EFFECT", "at": "@zeigarnik", "y": 0.86, "size": 120}], "sfx": [{"name": "reveal", "at": "@zeigarnik"}, {"name": "impact", "at": "@zeigarnik", "gain": 0.6}]}, {"text": "Back in the 1920s, a psychologist named Bluma Zeigarnik", "v": {"video": "../../stock/restaurant-order-0.mp4", "start": 1.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "overlays": [{"mg": "lower_third", "title": "BLUMA ZEIGARNIK", "sub": "Psychologist, Berlin (1927)", "at": 0.1}], "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "swoosh-fast", "at": 0.1, "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "noticed that waiters could remember every detail of an order that hadn't been paid yet.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-waiter.jpg", "focus": [0.6, 0.4], "zoom": 1.0, "to": [0.6, 0.25], "to_zoom": 1.5, "drift": 0}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "But the moment the bill was settled, the order vanished from their memory.", "v": {"mg": "receipt", "paid_at": "@settled"}, "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "bass", "at": "@settled", "gain": 0.6}], "in": "spin", "captions": false}, {"text": "Our minds hold on to things that are unfinished. Open loops.", "v": {"mg": "loop", "text": "UNFINISHED", "labels": []}, "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "It's the same reason a song you only hear half of gets stuck in your head all day.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/song-headphones-2.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "And when I read that, I almost laughed.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/walking-park-6.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "pause_before": 0.25, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "Because that was exactly it.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["THAT WAS IT.", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Lena wasn't stuck in my head because she was the love of my life.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-latenight.jpg", "focus": [0.65, 0.45], "zoom": 1.6}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "She was stuck because the story never ended.", "v": {"mg": "quote", "text": "She was stuck because the story never ended.", "end": "@ended", "width": 26}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "There was no last conversation. No explanation. No goodbye.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["NO LAST CONVERSATION.", "white"], ["NO EXPLANATION.", "white"], ["NO GOODBYE.", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0, "@explanation", "@goodbye"]}, "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "My brain was like that waiter, standing there holding an unpaid bill,", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-unpaid.jpg", "focus": [0.4, 0.4], "zoom": 1.1, "to_zoom": 1.5, "drift": 0}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "refusing to let go until someone settled it.", "v": {"mg": "receipt", "status": "UNPAID", "paid_at": 999.0}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "I really believe this is why the \"almost\" relationships hurt the most.", "v": {"mg": "marker", "lines": ["WHY \"ALMOST\"", "HURTS THE MOST"], "mark": ["HURTS THE MOST"], "times": [0.0, "@hurt"]}, "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "The situationships. The person who disappeared. The one you never got to say everything to.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/sad-woman-6.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "It's not that they mattered more.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/rain-4.mp4", "start": 4.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "It's that the ending never happened, so your mind keeps trying to write it.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-rewrite.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "Over and over, every night, a different version.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-rewrite.jpg", "focus": [0.75, 0.7], "zoom": 1.8}, "sfx": [{"name": "typing", "at": 0.1, "gain": 0.5}], "in": "cut"}, {"text": "What if I'd said this. What if she'd said that.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["WHAT IF I'D SAID THIS.", "white"], ["WHAT IF SHE'D SAID THAT.", "white"]], "times": [0.0, "@she'd"]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Your brain isn't remembering. It's trying to finish.", "v": {"mg": "versus", "left": ["NOT", "REMEMBERING"], "right": ["IT'S", "FINISHING"], "at": "@finish", "left_at": 0.0}, "sfx": [{"name": "reveal", "at": "@finish"}], "in": "cut", "captions": false}]}